        dcterms:description "Renders only a 2-panel synthetic comparison (`diatom_frustule_phase_sep_comparison.png`) without loading, SHA-256-verifying, or segmenting the vendored *Coscinodiscus wailesii* SEM micrograph (`datasets/diatom_frustule_phase_sep/coscinodiscus_diatom_specimen.jpg`)." ;
